\Exercise{52.}

Solve:

\Item{1.}  $\frac{2}{3}(x + 1) - \frac{1}{7}(x + 5) = 1$.

\Item{2.}  $\frac{6}{7}(x - 9) - \frac{1}{3}(5 - x) + 3x + 1 = 0$.

\Item{3.}  $\frac{1}{3}(5x - 24) + \frac{1}{7}(x - 2) - 2(x - 1) = 0$.

